title: "Cell-type wiring carries most of a whole-brain Drosophila model's accuracy: code and results"
abstract: "Shiu et al.'s whole-brain leaky integrate-and-fire model of Drosophila, run on the measured FlyWire v783 wiring and on 100 draws from each of four graded null-wiring families, and scored on the 164 experimental outcomes it was tested against."
